<title>GAMBIA: Ivorian '96/97 cocoa season to open in 2-3 days.</title>
<headline>Ivorian '96/97 cocoa season to open in 2-3 days.</headline>
<dateline>LIBREVILLE 1996-10-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Ivory Coast's 1996/97 cocoa marketing season will open in two to three days, Commodities Minister Guy Alain Gauze said on Monday.</p>
<p>&quot;It will open in two to three days,&quot; Gauze, speaking on the sidelines of a two-day ministerial review in Gabon of the 1993 International Cocoa Agreement, told reporters.</p>
</text>
